WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.968
Guys, it's Tuesday. It is time
for "WeTweet." Here we go.

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:07.400
-♪ WeTweet ♪

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.901
♪♪

00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:10.434
